===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To stream upward.
# {{lb|en|transitive|open-source software}} To have (a [[software]] [[library]], [[patch]], etc.) accepted by the [[original]] [[developer]]s of the related software, so that they maintain and distribute it.
#: {{ux|en|I'd be more than happy to '''upstream''' your patch.}}

